    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a proposal for a new multi-family residential complex in a fairly established neighborhood. I need to prep for a community meeting and I want to make sure I'm ready for the pushback. Can you give me a breakdown of the most common arguments people use against high-density zoning and new developments in these types of areas?",
